        <p>02 · 大爆炸的真相</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="75" width="800" height="40">
      <content textType="title" fontSize="26" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42, 42, 42, 1)" letterSpacing="1" wrap="false">
        <p>大爆炸不是奇迹，而是认知论本体对抗虚无的<span color="rgba(178, 58, 40, 1)">自我引爆</span></p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <line startX="80" startY="130" endX="880" endY="130">
